EmailTemplate.textOnly:
To {!Contact.FirstName},

We have not received a response to our offer to resolve this account.  Since settlement of this account prior to a potential lawsuit may keep your from incurring additional fees and costs we wanted to reach out to you again with a more extended term to work towards resolving the legal default.

At this time we are able to offer you the following monthly payment plan on the remaining balance:

- Ten (10) monthly payments of {!advpm__Matter__c.Settlement_Offer_10_Months__c}

If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.  If you are unable to pay the above settlement amount, but still want to resolve prior to any additional escalation, please reach out to us via phone or email.
Thank you,

{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Name__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Phone__c}
E: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Email__c}
